Using Prometheus with CI/CD
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure Prometheus monitoring system on a Linux machine
Set up Jenkins CI/CD pipeline with automated deployment triggers
Integrate Prometheus with Jenkins to monitor deployment metrics
Configure Prometheus alerting rules for CI/CD pipeline events
Create custom metrics for tracking deployment success and failure rates
Test the complete integration between Prometheus and Jenkins
Troubleshoot common issues in Prometheus-Jenkins integration
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Linux command line operations
Familiarity with CI/CD concepts and workflows
Knowledge of YAML configuration files
Understanding of HTTP requests and REST APIs
Basic knowledge of monitoring and alerting concepts
